{"id":"50e83f9005c41f2a","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-box-counting-dimension.md","title":"Cantor 类的上下 box 维数","display":"df-box-counting-dimension — Cantor 类的上下 box 维数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-box-counting-dimension","aliases":["43-df-box-counting-dimension"],"display":"df-box-counting-dimension — Cantor 类的上下 box 维数","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"§17.6.1, equation(17.1), printed pp.526–527 / PDF pp.546–547","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-box-counting-dimension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-box-counting-dimension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-box-counting-dimension — Cantor 类的上下 box 维数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§17.6.1, equation(17.1), printed pp.526–527 / PDF pp.546–547"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；圆柱见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>；为统一处理空集以下计数至少取1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_E(n):=|\\{\\sigma\\in2^n:E\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\}|.\n\\qquad\\underline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E):=\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\frac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,N_E(n)\\}}n.\n\\qquad\\overline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E):=\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\frac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,N_E(n)\\}}n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_E(n):=|\\{\\sigma\\in2^n:E\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\}|.\n\\qquad\\underline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E):=\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\frac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,N_E(n)\\}}n.\n\\qquad\\overline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E):=\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\frac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,N_E(n)\\}}n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留计数的log与上下极限；空类取0，不出现log0。该经典维数不对可数并稳定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；圆柱见 [[43-df-cylinder]]；为统一处理空集以下计数至少取1。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N_E(n):=|\\{\\sigma\\in2^n:E\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\}|.\n\\qquad\\underline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E):=\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n>0}\\frac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,N_E(n)\\}}n.\n\\qquad\\overline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E):=\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n>0}\\frac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,N_E(n)\\}}n.","display":true}],"bytes":1182,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-419","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-box-counting-dimension]] — Cantor 类的上下 box 维数"},{"id":"2795abfc568c9162","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]]、[[43-df-box-counting-dimension]]。"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}